OL,4,G2100FAll Star DJ Takeover: DJ Limelight
OL,5,     GDJ Limelight is keeping the All
OL,6,     GStar DJ Takeover going with
OL,7,     Gnothing but the biggest South
OL,8,     GAsian anthems in the mix.
OL,9,G2200FAll Star DJ Takeover: Kizzi
OL,10,     GKizzi's stepping into the mix
OL,11,     Gwith the ultimate party
OL,12,     Gsoundtrack, mixing old-school
OL,13,     Ganthems, club classics and all
OL,14,     Gyour British Asian favourites
OL,15,     Gguaranteed to keep the party
OL,16,     Ggoing.
OL,17,G2300FAll Star DJ Takeover: Kizzi
OL,18,     GIt's the end of the night, and
OL,19,     GKizzi's going to bring the house
OL,20,     Gdown! AND she might have a
OL,21,     Gspecial surprise in store...
